Name Type Description <code>$prefix</code> <code>string</code> Path prefix prepended to every route registered inside the group. <code>$callback</code> <code>callable</code> Closure that registers routes (e.g. <code>$app-&gt;get(...)</code>) for the group. <code>$middlewares</code> <code>array</code> Middlewares applied to every route registered inside the group. <pre><code>$app-&gt;group('/admin', function () use ($app) {
    $app-&gt;get('/users', function ($req, $res) {
        $res-&gt;withJson(['users' =&gt; []])-&gt;send();
    });
}, [$authMiddleware]);
</code></pre>
